OL,3,GNEWSACellist Jaquelin du Pre's
OL,4,Abelongings up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe belongings of a world-renowned
OL,7,Fcellist are expected to fetch "tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds," when they go
OL,9,Funder the hammer next month.
OL,11,FHandwritten letters, school reports and
OL,12,Fa childhood teddy bear are just some of
OL,13,Fthe items belonging to British cellist
OL,14,FJacqueline du Pre that are up for
OL,15,Fauction at Gardiner Holgate in Corsham,
OL,16,FWiltshire.
OL,18,FDu Pre performed her first cello
OL,19,Fconcert at the age of seven and went on
OL,20,Fto become one of the most renowned
OL,21,Finstrumentalists of the 20th century
OL,22,Fbefore her death in 1987.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
