OL,3,GNEWSACellist Jaquelin du Pre's
OL,4,Abelongings up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Most items in the sale were in boxes,
OL,7,Fhaving been stored in our homes for
OL,8,Fdecades," said Hilary Finzi, du Pre's
OL,9,Fsister.
